WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.218
A ball bearing lets

c2
00:00:01.218 --> 00:00:02.236
a shaft spin with

c3
00:00:02.236 --> 00:00:03.600
very little friction.

c4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.691
Steel balls roll between

c5
00:00:04.691 --> 00:00:05.782
an inner ring and

c6
00:00:05.782 --> 00:00:07.200
an outer ring.

c7
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.100
They roll instead of

c8
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:08.325
sliding,

c9
00:00:08.325 --> 00:00:09.225
so the balls circle

c10
00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:10.125
at less than half

c11
00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:11.400
the shaft speed.

